Colors: background #1B0A33, text #FFF0FB, secondary text #CDB0EA, accents #FF2E97, #00D9FF, #FFE14D. Font: "Anybody" from Google Fonts.
- First line: "Hi, I'm [YOUR NAME]"
- Scramble characters: Symbols
- Decode time: 1.2s
- Delay between letters: 40ms
- Plays when: On hover

Add it to my existing project as a component that fits its framework; tell me which files changed.
Keep it smooth, accessible, and respectful of reduced motion."
`;

